      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target community is individuals who grew up in the pre-smartphone era and now reflect nostalgically on that time, particularly those who identify with or critique modern smartphone culture. This includes people who perceive analog social interaction (like sharing cigarettes) as more authentic or engaging compared to the passive, digitally distracted lifestyle portrayed in the bottom image. The meme appeals to a demographic that values face-to-face interaction and may self-deprecatingly or humorously lament the shift toward digital distraction, using the contrast between the two scenes to evoke shared generational experiences and commentary on social behavior changes.",
